    "source_type": "TEXT",
    "text": "The customer request precedes order validation.\nOrder validation precedes inventory reservation.\nInventory reservation precedes payment authorization.\nPayment authorization precedes the shipment request.\nThe shipment request precedes notification dispatch.\nNotification dispatch precedes order completion.\nThe customer request requires the API gateway as its entry component.\nOrder validation requires the authentication service.\nThe authentication service requires the identity store.\nOrder validation requires the order service.\nThe order service requires the order database.\nInventory reservation requires the inventory service.\nThe inventory service requires the inventory database.\nPayment authorization requires the payment service.\nThe payment service requires the payment provider.\nThe payment service requires the fraud service.\nThe shipment request requires the shipping adapter.\nNotification dispatch requires the notification service.\nThe notification service requires the email provider.\nThe notification service requires the message broker.\nThe order service requires the message broker.\nThe inventory service requires the message broker.\nPayment authorization is measured by the observability collector.\nThe shipment request is measured by the observability collector.\nNotification dispatch is measured by the observability collector.\nThe observability collector requires the metrics store.\nThe order service creates audit-log records.\nThe payment service creates audit-log records."
  },
